  "2026-08-08T14:06:01.280Z","harness:codex","GitHub source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/937. Duplicate check searched all statuses for alias-indexed package rows, duplicated packages, catalog totals, and package-list count semantics. Closed pm-59gj and pm-x6jf own the package/SDK foundations but not this projection defect; no canonical issue existed."
